WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
Today is the day before your procedure, and this is the most important day of

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.000
your prep,

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.650
so let's make it count. Starting today, you must drink clear liquids only,

4
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:10.880
which includes water,

5
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:16.170
broth, plain tea, black coffee, clear juices, and plain gelatin. Stay well hyd

6
00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:16.880
rated throughout

7
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:22.130
the day. And remember, no solid foods, no alcohol, and no dairy. Avoid anything

8
00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:22.960
red,

9
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:27.460
purple, blue, or orange, as these dyes can be mistaken for blood during the

10
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.240
procedure.

11
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.120
Begin your bowel prep exactly when your prep instruction sheet says to.

12
00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:37.620
Don't skip ahead or delay. If you're on a split-dose schedule, your second

13
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:37.840
dose will

14
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.670
be taken the morning of your procedure. Your instruction sheet will have the

15
00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:42.800
exact timing for that.

16
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:48.100
One important note about your ride tomorrow: rideshares and taxis are fine for

17
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:48.480
getting

18
00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:52.980
you to your procedure. But after your procedure, you may only use a rideshare

19
00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:53.840
or taxi if a

20
00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:58.780
companion who is 18 or older is in the car with you. Going home alone in a ride

21
00:00:58.780 --> 00:00:59.840
share or taxi

22
00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:03.760
is not permitted — please make sure you have that arranged in advance. You're

23
00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:05.280
almost there, stick with

24
00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:05.600
it.
